# KSV-0014 (readOnlyRootFilesystem): every stateful container in this chart
# (postgresql, rabbitmq, mediamtx, and the opentakserver/cot-parser/
# eud-handler/eud-handler-ssl/webui containers) currently runs with a
# writable root filesystem - none of them have been individually verified to
# still work with it locked down (data dirs, temp files, config
# regeneration). This is accepted technical debt, not a false positive or a
# deliberate design choice like a sibling Helm chart's KSV-0014 exception -
# revisit as a dedicated hardening pass, container by container, with real
# testing per container rather than flipping the flag chart-wide.
KSV-0014
